    ],
  },
  {
    category: '3. Petite and tall are the same chart',
    text: [
      `Old Navy's women's bottoms chart has three tabs. Regular, petite and tall are identical: the same waist and the same hip at every size from 000 through 20. Not similar. The same numbers. Tops, outerwear and dresses does the same across its three tabs.`,
