    category: '6. Two measurements Old Navy never explains',
    text: [
      `The belt chart is keyed to waist and <strong>high hip</strong>. The bra chart is keyed to chest and <strong>underbust</strong>. Neither high hip nor underbust appears in any other Old Navy chart, and neither appears in Old Navy's own measuring instructions, which cover chest, waist, hips/butt, inseam and foot and stop there.`,
